---
import ArrowDiagonal from '../../assets/icons/arrow-diagonal.svg'
import discoverPlanPhoto from '../../assets/home/discover-plan.jpg'
---

<section class="relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#ed8419] py-[164px]">
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-32 -top-32 size-[600px] rounded-full bg-white/10 blur-[120px]"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-40 top-1/3 size-[550px] rounded-full bg-white/10 blur-[120px]"
  >
  </div>
  <div class="relative flex w-full max-w-[1216px] gap-[104px] overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white p-8">
    <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-start justify-center gap-8 py-16 pl-10">
      <p class="font-sans text-[64px] leading-[1.3] tracking-[-1.28px] text-[#2e2e2e]">
        Descubre el plan que más encaja con vos
      </p>
      <p class="font-sans text-2xl tracking-[-0.48px] text-[#2e2e2e]">
        Responde algunas preguntas y conoce el plan de internet perfecto para tu hogar.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="/planes-por-fibra-optica/"
          class="font-franklin-medium flex items-center gap-2 rounded-[35px] bg-[#25d366] px-8 py-4 text-base tracking-[-0.32px] text-[#181818]"
        >
          Descubrir mi plan ideal
          <img src={ArrowDiagonal.src} alt="" class="size-6" />
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/595983550110"
          class="font-franklin-medium flex items-center gap-2 rounded-[35px] border-[1.5px] border-[#181818] px-8 py-4 text-base tracking-[-0.32px] text-[#181818]"
        >
          Hablar con un representante
          <img src={ArrowDiagonal.src} alt="" class="size-3" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative w-[456px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-[#d9d9d9]">
      <img src={discoverPlanPhoto.src} alt="" class="size-full object-cover" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
